---
layout: base.njk
title: Join or contact us
description: Apply to volunteer with the Elder Mountain Fire Department as a firefighter or support member, or send us a question.
permalink: /contact/
---
<article class="contact">
  <div class="contact-info">
    <h1>Join or contact us</h1>
    <p class="lede">Want to help your community? We are always accepting applications for firefighters and support members. Questions and information requests come here too.</p>
    <p class="contact-911"><strong>For emergencies, dial 911.</strong> This form and our email are not monitored around the clock.</p>
    <dl class="contact-facts">
      <div><dt>Station</dt><dd>{{ site.station.street }}<br>{{ site.station.city }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Mailing address</dt><dd>{{ site.mailing.street }}<br>{{ site.mailing.city }}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-form-wrap">
    {% include "form.njk" %}
  </div>
</article>
